  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP Yemen ERRY II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Supporting Resilient Livelihoods and Food Security in Yemen JP (ERRY II) funds integrated initiatives that strengthen the resilience of crisis-affected communities in Yemen. Interventions are designed to reach the most vulnerable community members (e.g. women, unemployed, youth, and internally displaced people) through the application of sustainable livelihood and basic service approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
